desc:BP StepGate
author: Alessio - Blind Producers
version: 1.1

// --- Global Control Parameters ---
slider1:2<0,7,1{1/1 (Whole),1/2 (Half),1/4 (Quarter),1/8,1/16,1/32,1/64,1/128}>Grid Size
slider2:1<1,32,1>PR Start (Pattern Range Start)
slider3:32<1,32,1>PR Stop (Pattern Range Stop)

// --- Global ADSR ---
slider4:2<0,500,1>Global Attack (ms)
slider5:0<0,500,1>Global Decay (ms)
slider6:1<0,1,0.01>Global Sustain (Level 0-1)
slider7:5<0,500,1>Global Release (ms)

// --- Steps 01 - 32 ---
